'''Soft and Flexible''' (伸縮性と弾力性, ''Shinshukusei to Danryokusei'', '''Flexibility and Elasticity''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 7.4 Update|Version 7.4]].

==Effect==
Cat Base Defense UP (M): Cat Base health is increased by 50%.

